NOTE ON SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a WORKFLOW DEMONSTRATION RELEASE. It is intended to make the
end-to-end operation of the AIIDS framework easier to follow. It does NOT
represent the complete implementation of the system; see README.md for details.
